p({"class":"foam.core.ai.vector.test.RAGTest","id":"RAGTest","description":"EmbeddingAware statuses and EmbeddingSync: a save marks the record NEW, DIRTY or DISCARDED with no AI call, one sync embeds it, chunks of several records go in one call, a failing provider costs one warning per sync, a refused record does not stop the others, the first sync removes the chunks of a record that is gone"})
